ew of a file’s contents without launching the application associated with the file. For example, a preview handler displays a Shell item in the Windows Explorer preview pane.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="761308">preview handler</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1799865">پيش منظر کار</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20984_761629_1521413"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collaborative action, such as sharing, calendar sharing, or using a whiteboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="761629">activity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1521413">سرگرمی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2099_2397421_3114789"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A subset of the contents of a data warehouse that tends to contain data focused at the department level, or on a specific business area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397421">DataMart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114789">ڈیٹا مارٹ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termN