narration, slides, mouse clicks, A/V playback, and laser pointer highlights. The user can select which presentation aspects to record.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1062909">Record Slide Show</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1217781">ریکارڈ سلائیڈ نمایش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23214_1064085_1649594"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A map view created from aerial photos that shows buildings, roads, and geographical features.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1064085">aerial view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1649594">فضائی منظر</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2323_61200_3042408"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to the base-16 number system represented by the digits 0 through 9 and the uppercase or lowercase letters A (equivalent to decimal 10) through F (equivalent to decimal 15). Hexadecimal values are commonly used in HTML code to identify colors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="61200">hex</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term 