r program buttons to the documents, pictures, songs, or websites a user frequently accesses.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2145328">jump list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676096">فوری فہرست</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32402_1673093_1680305"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A nonfinal release of Internet Explorer 10.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673093">Internet Explorer 10 Consumer Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1680305">Internet Explorer 10 Consumer Preview</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32403_1673106_1681401"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A short video sent as an email message to someone in the contact list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673106">video mail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681401">ویڈیو ڈاک</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNot