ar</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39269_2277947_2322426"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unit in the Office Graph that represents an entity, an action or a relationship between people, items, and people and items across Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2277947">Office Graph node</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322426">Office گراف نوڈ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39270_2277948_2322411"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of Office Graph node that represents actual entities in the Office Graph, such as a person or a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2277948">entity node</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322411">وجود نوڈ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39271_2277949_2322429"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of Office Graph node that represents a relationship between two or more nodes with their own set of properties in the Office Graph.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2277949">relationship node</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig><