ter hacking attacks in which a person with no authorization accesses a network and stays there undetected for a long period of time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370577">advanced persistent threat</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054766">APT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41879_2370578_3054763"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of computer hacking attacks in which a person with no authorization accesses a network and stays there undetected for a long period of time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370578">APT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054763">اعلی درجے کا مستقل خطرہ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41879_2370578_3054766"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of computer hacking attacks in which a person with no authorization accesses a network and stays there undetected for a long period of time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370578">APT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054766">APT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4188_136987_1216896"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make a chart sheet or worksheet the active, or selected, sheet. The sheet that you activate determines which menu bar and toolbars are displayed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136987">activate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216896">فعال کریں</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41880_2370579_2371764"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A biometric authentication feature that that enables signing in to your device, apps, online services, and networks by face recognition.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370579">Windows Hello face</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2371764">Windows Hello چہرہ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41881_2370580_2371765"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A biometric authentication feature that that enables signing in to your device, apps, online services, and networks by fingerprint recognition.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370580"