 helps the user import digital video to the computer from digital video cameras and other sources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262696">Import Video</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="402717">وڈیو درآمد کریں</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41917_2372848_2379042"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel function which takes an expression and performs an implicit intersection when the expression is a range, returns the top left value when expression is an array, and otherwise just returns the expression.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2372848">SINGLE()</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2379042">SINGLE()</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41919_2373340_2373684"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A timeframe that a customer sets to describe when they usually use their device, during which automatic restarts will not happen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373340">active hours</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373684">فعال گھنٹے</term><termNote type="geographica