s file name extension, and indicates which program the file was created in and can be opened with.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="54362">file type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2247620">قسم فائل</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44738_2519484_2521161"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The preview version of Microsoft Whiteboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2519484">Microsoft Whiteboard Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521161">Microsoft Whiteboard Preview</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44754_2520241_2521155"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A card that contains actions that users can take without leaving the page or application that they are in.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520241">actionable message card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521155">قابل عمل پیغام کارڈ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44755_2520242_2521157"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to create and interact with actionable message cards.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520242">Actionable Messages</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521157">قابل عمل پیغامات</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44765_2520274_3115121"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to control access to rows in a database table based on the characteristics of the user executing a query (e.g., group membership or execution context).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520274">Row Level Security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115121">قطار کی سطح کی سیکورٹی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44765_2520275_3115121"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to control access to rows in a database table based on the characteristics of the user executing a query (e.g., group membership or execution context).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520275">RLS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115121">قطار کی سطح کی سیکورٹی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44765_3114827_3115121"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to control access to rows in a database table based on the characteristics of the user executing a query (e.g., group membership or execution context).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114827">row-level security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115121">قطار کی سطح کی سیکورٹی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44776_2520537_2523102"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A message that contains an actionable message card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520537">actionable message</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2523102">قابل عمل پیغام</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><