ype="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3041427">ونڈو گیمنگ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53368_3041363_3041417"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Gaming that utilizes a display format in which the game/application is run in a window at full-screen size without a border, creating the experience of full-screen gaming while also allowing for other overlays on top of the game, similar to the windowed gaming experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3041363">borderless-windowed gaming</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3041417">سرحد سے پاک ونڈو گیمنگ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53370_3041605_3112184"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft personalized feed website that is designed to make it easy to gather news and information content from premium publishers in one place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3041605">Microsoft Start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3112184">Microsoft Start</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNot