5 capability that allows the user to work offline in your Cloud PC environment and sync when reconnected.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054432">Windows 365 Offline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055694">Windows 365 آف لائن</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53664_3054433_3055692"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows 365 capability that allows the user to boot directly to your Cloud PC.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054433">Windows 365 Boot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055692">Windows 365 بوٹ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53665_3054434_3055695"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows 365 capability that allows the user to swipe between desktop and a Cloud PC/Windows 365 environment as part of task view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054434">Windows 365 Switch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055695">Windows 365 سوئچ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53668_3055383_3059355"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to device features that can detect if someone is coming or going from a device, triggering the device to wake or lock.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055383">presence sensing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059355">موجودگی کا احساس</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53669_3055384_3055690"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature on select devices with a sensor to detect motion as someone approaches so the device powers back on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055384">wake on approach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055690">قریب آنے پر بیدار ہونا</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53670_3055385_3055687"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature on select devices with the proper sensor to detect motion as someone walks away from their device so it powers down/sleeps to save power.</descrip></descripGrp><