ular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54050_3080961_3081389"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The argument in the DATEVALUE Excel function that represents a date in an Excel date format, or a reference to a cell that contains text that represents a date in an Excel date format.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080961">date_text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3081389">date_text</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54051_3080962_3081399"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The argument in an Excel function that specifies a number in the date-time code used by Excel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080962">serial_number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3081399">serial_number</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54062_3083270_3084386"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Clock app which helps users minimize distractions by turning on Do Not Disturb and silencing icon flashing and badge notifications for apps in the taskbar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083270">focus session</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</te