ation of violations of security policies and recommended practices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096555">incident handling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096812">واقعہ ہینڈلنگ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54304_3096556_3096819"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security incident that involves the accidental or unauthorized exposure or alteration of customer content and end-user identifiable information (EUII) in Microsoft 365 services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096556">privacy issue</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096819">رازداری کا مسئلہ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54312_3097234_3098602"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An observable change to the normal behavior of a system, environment, process, workflow or person; any observable occurrence in a system or network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097234">security event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3098602">سیکیورٹی وقوعہ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote