dents to find relevant learning resources in Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103943">Classwork</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105354">کلاس ورک</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54662_3103944_3105356"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integrated security approach that covers the entire lifecycle of cloud-native applications by combining cloud security posture management (CSPM), cloud workload protection (CWP), cloud infrastructure entitlement management (CIEM), and cloud applications security broker (CASB).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103944">Cloud-Native Application Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105356">کلاؤڈ نیٹیو ایپلی کیشن کا تحفظ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54662_3103944_3105375"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integrated security approach that covers the entire lifecycle of cloud-native applications by combining cloud security posture management (CSPM), cloud workload protection (CWP), cloud infrastructure entitlement management (CIEM), and cloud applications security broker (CASB).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103944">Cloud-Native Application Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105375">CNAPP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54662_3103945_3105356"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integrated security approach that covers the entire lifecycle of cloud-native applications by combining cloud security posture management (CSPM), cloud workload protection (CWP), cloud infrastructure entitlement management (CIEM), and cloud applications security broker (CASB).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103945">CNAPP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105356">کلاؤڈ نیٹیو ایپلی کیشن کا تحفظ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54662_3103945_3105375"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integrated security approach that covers the entire lifecycle of cloud-native applications by combining cloud security posture management (CSPM), cloud workload protection (CWP), cloud infrastructure entitlement management (CIEM), and cloud applications security broker (CASB).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103945">CNAPP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105375">CNAPP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54663_3103946_3105353"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Security kit that includes infographics, videos, and an email to help users protect identities, devices, and data, safeguard from phishing and other scams, manage passwords efficiently and keep software up to date.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103946">Be Cyber Smart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105353">سائبر اسمارٹ بنیں</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54664_3103947_3105377"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Jargon or popular language for the use of multiple cloud computing and storage services in a single heterogeneous architecture.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103947">multicloud</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105377">ملٹی کلاؤڈ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54665_3103948_3105378"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows customers to cryptographically tie tokens to the device a user originally signed in from.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103948">token protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105378">ٹوکن تحفظ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5467_375735_380558"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mechanism that helps reduce the volume of antivirus scanning that is required across an organization by stamping messages that have been scanned for viruses with metadata that indicates the version of the antivirus software that performed the scan and the result of that scan. This metadata, or "stamp," travels securely with the message as it is routed through different email servers within the organization and is used to determine whether subsequent additional virus scanning on the message can be bypassed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="375735">antivirus stamping</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="380558">وائرس مخالف اسٹامپنگ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5469_177200_402386"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A message sent to the user or administrator of a system where the recipient may be a human or an automated notification manager.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="177200">notification</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="402386">اعلان</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54694_3105975_3106656"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tree-planting initiative sponsored by Microsoft by which players grow a virtual seed into a tree by completing tasks on the weather page. Once the virtual tree is grown, Microsoft sponsors the planting of a real tree.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105975">E-tree</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3106656">E-tree</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54695_3106186_3106661"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A transient view that appears above other content on screen to describe or add additional information when users hover over, focus on, or click an interactive element.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3106186">popover</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3106661">پاپ اوور</term><te