ed with that wallet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3143255">recovery phrase</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3143808">بازیابی کا جملہ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55446_3143256_3143809"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A percentage that represents the difference between the expected price of a cryptocurrency at the time of a transaction and the actual price when the transaction is executed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3143256">slippage tolerance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3143809">گراوٹ کی حد</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55447_3143312_3143812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the context of cryptocurrency, a digital unit of a digital currency that is used as a specific asset or a representation of a particular use on a blockchain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3143312">token</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ur"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3143812">ٹوکن</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">PAK</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote typ